{
  "$description": "Font vibes: what the docs menu, preview cards and slateos.js list. The families themselves are defined in src/font-themes.css ([data-font='name']); the build fails if the two disagree. Every font is open source (SIL OFL 1.1) and self-hosted from Fontsource. group: sans | serif (serif headings over a sans body) | mono.",
